Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether there's a sequence enumerating all positive rationals (without repetition) such that $\sqrt[n]{a_n}$ converges.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains only the problem statement — no leaked solutions or answers. Proceeding to solve.

